<article class="card">
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<div class="meta">Effective {effective}</div>
<p>Paradise Shows is a business operations application provided by Paradise Exteriors LLC for planning, evaluating, booking, paying for, and reviewing events and shows.</p>
<h2>Information the app processes</h2>
<p>The app may process business-operational information such as event details, organizer contact information, task assignments, booking status, payment status, notes, historical show performance, and other records entered or maintained for business operations.</p>
<p>When the app connects to its hosted services, infrastructure providers may process technical information needed to deliver and secure the service, such as IP address, network request information, device/browser characteristics, timestamps, and diagnostic or security logs.</p>
<h2>How information is used</h2>
<ul><li>Operate and secure the Paradise Shows service.</li><li>Display current event, task, payment, and historical information.</li><li>Support authorized business updates and operational workflows.</li><li>Troubleshoot reliability, security, and data-quality issues.</li></ul>
<h2>Tracking and advertising</h2>
<p>Paradise Shows does not use third-party advertising SDKs and is not designed to track users across other companies’ apps or websites for advertising purposes.</p>
<h2>Service providers</h2>
<p>The service uses infrastructure providers, including Cloudflare for application delivery and Supabase for hosted application services and data access. These providers may process information on behalf of Paradise Exteriors as necessary to provide and secure their services.</p>
<h2>Device permissions</h2>
<p>The current app does not request access to precise location, contacts, photos, camera, microphone, Bluetooth, Health data, or advertising identifiers. If a future version adds a device permission or materially changes data practices, this policy and the App Store privacy disclosures should be updated before release.</p>
<h2>Data retention and security</h2>
<p>Business records are retained according to operational, contractual, legal, and audit needs. Paradise Exteriors uses reasonable administrative and technical safeguards designed to protect the service and its information.</p>
<h2>Third-party links</h2>
<p>The app may open organizer websites, source documents, email records, or other third-party services. Their privacy practices are governed by their own policies.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions or privacy requests may be directed to Paradise Exteriors LLC at <a href="mailto:info@paradiseexteriors.com">info@paradiseexteriors.com</a> or 561-732-0300.</p>
<p>Paradise Exteriors LLC<br/>1918 Corporate Dr<br/>Boynton Beach, FL 33426</p>
